#### [NEW] [`core/rerankers/cross_encoder.py`](file:///d:/Github_Clones/ShopRank/core/rerankers/cross_encoder.py)

- Loads `BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3` on CPU at process start (singleton pattern like `BGEProvider`).
- Model weights saved to `D:\huggingface_cache` per AGENTS.md rule.
- Logs cold-load time via structured logging.
- Signature: `rerank(query: Query, hits: list[ScoredHit], top_k: int) -> list[ScoredHit]`
- For each hit, adds `rerank_score` and `rank_before_rerank` to `ScoreBreakdown`.
- **Preserves** all existing breakdown fields (`bm25_score`, `dense_score`, `fused_score`).
