**Implementation detail:** The cross-encoder takes `(query, passage)` pairs. We need the product text for each hit. The reranker will accept an additional `product_texts: dict[str, str]` mapping `product_id -> text`, fetched from the DB in the pipeline before calling rerank. This avoids the reranker needing DB access.

